Z||000000||Spektrum-87GT||09-15-2001||12:37 AM||||every time i tell someone who thinks they know anything and everything about cars i own a fiero gt, they cringe and tell me how pathetic it is. Then i ask them if they've ever owned one or even been in one... and of course, most say no or make up a story. People that don't know a hoot about cars almost always say 'isnt that the kind of car that burned up?' Why does the fiero have such a bad rep!? Ok.. i know its a little harder than most cars to do regular maintainence, but its a labor of love dangit! Also, GM seems to hate it, and come close to denying its existance. i emailed them, asking if there would be another fiero in the future, and i got a one word response... 'No.' Sorry... had to vent.||||reg||1
Z||000001||dennis_6||09-15-2001||01:18 AM||||Just keep emailing them like I do.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Let them know we want these cars.  If the Corvette is threatened the the Corvette must be a pathetic car.  As far as people puting down the Fiero.  Try taking them for a ride in the car and then tell them what they just rode in.  They won't belive it.  ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Haze_Performance||09-15-2001||02:05 AM||||I must say....... The same thing has happened to me 99% of the time. I get VERY mad when a braininess twit talks bad about a car they have never owned, worked on, driven or rode in. I lost my temper on a guy in the gas station. He walked over & said <I>"WOW!! I Ain't see one of those in years!! I thought they all burned up by now.</I> (  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> ) <I>My brother had one in the 80's,</I> (No Kiddin?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> ) <I>it didn't last 2 weeks before it flamed up"</I> I told him "You are a ignorant, brain less, fool!!!" There was a older guy at the pump next to me. He just looked at me & smiled. <P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>                <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">                <BR></A><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/halfpole_6.gif"> ||||reg||8
